#file:			  /BBC_LUT_Release_v1-8_Grouped_2026-09-16/Deprecated_Conversions/2f_PQ4000_HLG_Type3_Transcode_withcomp-v1-8.cube
#creation:		  Wed Sep 16 10:36:47 2026
#description:     Apply static PQ display management tone mapping with a master monitor peak of 1000.000000 and master black of 0.000000
#                 Convert PQ to HLG assuming a grading master peak of 1000.000000cd/m^2
#                 With a fix to correct colour conversion matrix where bt.709 ycbcr<->rgb is assumed
#                 Processes full range of signal with appropriate input and output scaling
